                            "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
                            "params": {
                                "text": "\n<h3 id=\"ch1-not-a-wiki-link\">Not A Wiki Link</h3>\n<p>These are not wiki links and must survive exactly as written:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>inline code: <code>[[literal]]</code></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>a shortcut reference: <a href=\"https://h5p.org\" target=\"_blank\">ref</a></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>a bare bracket pair: [not a link]</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"background-color:#f6f8fa\">\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"><span style=\"color:#d73a49\">if</span> [[ -f x ]]; <span style=\"color:#d73a49\">then</span> <span style=\"color:#6f42c1\">echo</span> <span style=\"color:#6f42c1\">yes</span>; <span style=\"color:#d73a49\">fi\n</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n"
                            },
